      "title": "Paradigm Shifts and the Winner's Curse",
      "link": "https://stratechery.com/2025/paradigm-shifts-and-the-winners-curse/?access_token=eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6InN0cmF0ZWNoZXJ5LnBhc3Nwb3J0Lm9ubGluZSIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..HOl6wH84FiuRX8PFwtdl-L3vp3CjJ04iSbfCS3btA5TKujI5O0z-IYH5QwkPU5ZtfBFUbMI0woHuNMB-z6uW7uc72sP5pH9efowjXhOPbIfGjrj_rH5kttMtQS57txA-u9VQsaLYp-TpghHeHF4TTsq75UbPV0qqdSbwghI35YN7ZiSpnRlFQYb-s0bG1q-3WxV-2EQMnY4oQfduD_rXvshxoDmxOxIknJQFf5VHh0XIZQ8H8c0PHcHwDkI8jG9BE7NdMttP7T1Ye8T8cjewkYKKUcXgo-k48QUw4NCYf8FUa2ajhka0jaJH4jriSryawUVPC6Ay2Keq5WzcF2SGVg",
      "source": "Stratechery",
      "summary": "When paradigms change, previous winners have the hardest time adjusting; that is why AI might be a challenge for Apple and Amazon",
      "llmComment": "苹果和亚马逊等科技巨头正面临着人工智能（AI）带来的挑战，这是因为它们在原有范式中取得了成功，难以适应新的技术变革。苹果和亚马逊的核心差异化在于它们对用户体验和服务的重视，但在AI领域，它们可能需要重新调整自己的战略。潜在的市场机会在于AI技术的广泛应用，但同时也面临来自其他专注于AI的公司的竞争威胁，尚待观察这些科技巨头如何应对这一挑战。值得持续追踪的信号是苹果和亚马逊在AI领域的投资和创新动向，以及它们如何将AI技术融入到自己的产品和服务中。",
      "pubDate": "2025-08-06T15:33:50.000Z",
